+Code the following app
+```
+A quiz that allows someone to find out which blockchain (base, ethereum, solana, bitcoin) they are most similar to by answering 5 multiple choice questions and be able to share result. Generate an image for each blockchain based on their official logo and display it on the result page with a description that highlights the main advantages of that that blockchain. Allow the user to retake the quiz as many times as they want. Write the questions and answers yourself. Randomize the order of the answers for each question.
+
+Place the quiz on the home page.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

